 {
  "verse_id": "tsa-a21-v06",
  "song": "tsa-a21",
  "verse": 6,
  "quick_english": "Like the brahma-killing-prohibition, ritual-distinction and ritual-excellence — in its absence somewhere being-unqualified: same, like the ashrama-distinction; and from fruit-excellence, excellence just-there. In Upaniṣad-Bhāgavata, in distinct-authorship even, being-made-by-all-knowers is conceivable here — from conjunction of meaning in what-is-said-and-beyond. In eternality even, scriptures' recognition: for-now necessarily-reached, from being-rooted-in-inference-elimination-perception-and-rest — their authority. 'I see gold [and] silver' — indeed, recognition is scripture, through goldsmith-and-others' recognition. Some with-seen-fruit a desirer enjoys: child's engagement just by recognition, not-by-inference-and-elimination — then, from those two's absence, in youth its presence is powerless. But rooting recognition, he — let him be — for someone, some work: some giving fruits of invisible-impotence-nature-dissolution-solitude, some of equality-with-Siva, some ending-in-oneness — she severally many-kinded: thus in a world filled with many recognitions, whoever to-be, he just such recognition by force indeed assumes, ending-in-the-heart.",
